_thumb/scz773.jpg"}, {"id": 1691347, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1091v.jpg"}], "slug": "there-is-more", "storyline": "when the last humans vanished, only ruins and silence remained.\nBeneath the broken stones lies the Ancient Core, a heart of living mana.\nIt breathes warmth into the dead city, keeping the dark away.\n\nBut each night the ground cracks open.\nFrom the shadows crawl monsters, and worse things - drawn to the Core\u2019s light.\nIf it falls, the city will crumble forever and all hope with it.\n\nOnly one nameless protector stands guard.\nNo crown, no past - only steel, blood, and the will to endure.\n\nThe Core must be defended at all costs.", "summary": "In this procedurally generated mining roguelite you dig for precious ores by day and defend your city from relentless monsters by night. Each night the waves attacking the core are getting deadlier - upgrade your gear, unlock powerful spells, and descend deeper. Can you survive 10 nights?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/there-is-more", "videos": [{"id": 190712, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "z6Aqt204DXQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z6Aqt204DXQ", "title": "There Is mORE - Mining Roguelike with powerful spells - Early Access Trailer (short)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/z6Aqt204DXQ/qhddefault.jpg"}]}